{"1427890": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Blaston", "steam_appid": 1427890, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "dlc": [1795940], "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1427890/extras/cacad4d07fe094dae228bb8f91a489e1.poster.avif?t=1681359966\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1427890/extras/cacad4d07fe094dae228bb8f91a489e1.webm?t=1681359966\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1427890/extras/cacad4d07fe094dae228bb8f91a489e1.mp4?t=1681359966\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Blaston is a fast-paced PvP VR shooter where your survival hinges on one simple rule: Never. Stay. Still.<br><br>Duel players in a slow-motion bullet-hell as you collect weapons, personalize your loadout, and move your whole body to dodge oncoming fire as you line up your next perfect shot. Customize your weapons with game-changing attachments, glow up your avatar and arsenal with new looks, and create player-hosted tournaments in the Ozo Lounge. Get ready to break a sweat!<br><br>💥 FREE-TO-PLAY — Everyone can get in on the action and take aim on the competition<br>💥 REVAMPED STORE — Re-organized with all new categories for an improved player experience<br>💥 MORE WEAPON ATTACHMENTS — 24 brand new options for 8 different weapon types<br>💥 MORE STYLE OPTIONS — New avatar and weapon skins are ready to equip<br><br>Blaston Spectator app available for PC.<br><br>Blaston — a game of firepower and physicality from the cyberpunk warriors at Resolution Games.", "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1427890/extras/cacad4d07fe094dae228bb8f91a489e1.poster.avif?t=1681359966\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1427890/extras/cacad4d07fe094dae228bb8f91a489e1.webm?t=1681359966\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1427890/extras/cacad4d07fe094dae228bb8f91a489e1.mp4?t=1681359966\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Blaston is a fast-paced PvP VR shooter where your survival hinges on one simple rule: Never. Stay. Still.<br><br>Duel players in a slow-motion bullet-hell as you collect weapons, personalize your loadout, and move your whole body to dodge oncoming fire as you line up your next perfect shot. Customize your weapons with game-changing attachments, glow up your avatar and arsenal with new looks, and create player-hosted tournaments in the Ozo Lounge. Get ready to break a sweat!<br><br>💥 FREE-TO-PLAY — Everyone can get in on the action and take aim on the competition<br>💥 REVAMPED STORE — Re-organized with all new categories for an improved player experience<br>💥 MORE WEAPON ATTACHMENTS — 24 brand new options for 8 different weapon types<br>💥 MORE STYLE OPTIONS — New avatar and weapon skins are ready to equip<br><br>Blaston Spectator app available for PC.<br><br>Blaston — a game of firepower and physicality from the cyberpunk warriors at Resolution Games.", "short_description": "In the slow-motion bullet-hell of Blaston, you duck, dodge, and weave to evade incoming attacks while preparing your dazzling next combos in a flash of skill. You feel like Neo and leave each session with your heart racing in this super fun tactical workout. Most importantly... Never. Stay. Still.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, German, Japanese, Korean, Russian, Swedish, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Italian, Traditional Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "reviews": "“One of the Best VR Experiences of 2020... with a surprising amount of strategy.”<br>5/5 – TheGamer<br><br>“Whether you’re a fan of competitive 1v1 battles, strategy-based gunplay, or just enjoy dodging bullets Keanu Reeves-style, Blaston is an absolute must-buy.”<br>VR Scout<br><br>“Challenges the notion of what a ‘VR shooter’ can be...a genius arrangement”<br>RoadToVR<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1427890/header.jpg?t=1681359966", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1427890/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1681359966", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1427890/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1681359966", "website": "http://blaston.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-4590/AMD FX 8350 equivalent or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1050 Ti / AMD Radeon RX 470 or greater<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 200 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> SteamVR. Standing or Room Scale</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "legal_notice": "Copyrights and trademarks are property of their respective owners.", "developers": ["Resolution Games"], "publishers": ["Resolution Games"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"w